=== rollback ===
+----+------+
| id | name |
+----+------+
|  1 | keep |
+----+------+
1 row in set
=== commit ===
+----+-------+
| id | name  |
+----+-------+
|  1 | keep  |
|  3 | kept! |
+----+-------+
2 rows in set
=== rollback undoes UPDATE and DELETE too ===
+----+-------+
| id | name  |
+----+-------+
|  1 | keep  |
|  3 | kept! |
+----+-------+
2 rows in set
